  "level": 2,
  "questionLabels": [],
  "question": {
    "text": "Number of moles of methane required to produce <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>22</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo> </mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub></math> after combustion is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>–</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> moles. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></math> is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "50",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>→</mo><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></math></p><p>Gram molecular mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>(</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>44</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mo>/</mo><mi>mol</mi></math></p><p>From the reaction, it is clear that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> mole of methane on complete combustion produces <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>44</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> (<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn></math> mole) of carbon dioxide.</p><p>Therefore moles of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>4</mn></msub></math> required to produce <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>22</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></math> are:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>44</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn><mo> </mo><mi>mol</mi><mo> </mo><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo> </mo><mi>mol</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace></math></p><p>Hence, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
